{"id":"cell-3ez5a4-ml1vo2sbarf","title":"检查 Go 环境并安装","description":"检查并安装 Go 环境\n\n任务：\n1. 检查系统中是否已安装 Go (1.23+)\n2. 如果未安装，安装 Go\n3. 验证安装并报告版本\n\n命令参考：\n- 检查: go version\n- Linux 安装: sudo apt update && sudo apt install golang-go\n- 或从官网: wget https://go.dev/dl/go1.23.0.linux-amd64.tar.gz && tar -C /usr/local -xzf go1.23.0.linux-amd64.tar.gz","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-01-31T05:34:56.795Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T05:39:50.692Z","closed_at":"2026-01-31T05:39:50.692Z","parent_id":"cell-3ez5a4-ml1vo2rhca3","dependencies":[],"labels":[],"comments":[]}
