{"id":"cell-3ez5a4-ml1vygc74pf","title":"修复 Linux 平台兼容性问题","description":"stock_data_api.go 文件导入了 Windows 特有的 registry 包但没有使用 build 标签，导致在 Linux 上无法编译。\n\n需要：\n1. 从 stock_data_api.go 移除 Windows 特有的导入和函数\n2. 创建 stock_data_api_windows.go 包含 Windows 特定的代码\n3. 创建 stock_data_api_linux.go 包含 Linux 特定的代码（或空实现）","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","created_at":"2026-01-31T05:43:00.919Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T05:43:00.919Z","parent_id":"cell-3ez5a4-ml1vo2rhca3","dependencies":[],"labels":[],"comments":[]}
